OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry for most with sunny spells.
OL,6,FThe odd shower may affect western
OL,7,Fparts at times, while eastern parts
OL,8,Fwill see the best of the sunshine.
OL,9,FStrong winds throughout the day, with
OL,10,Fcoastal gales. The wind eases during
OL,11,Fthe afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear and dry to start the
OL,14,Fnight. Soon clouding over, with rain
OL,15,Fmoving in from the west affecting most
OL,16,Fplaces by Monday morning. The wind
OL,17,Feases to a light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
