OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA grey and wet start to the
OL,6,Fday, with rain clearing northeastwards
OL,7,Fduring the afternoon. Drier conditions
OL,8,Ffollow, but skies remain cloudy for
OL,9,Fmost. Turning breezy, especially along
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBreezy
OL,13,Fwith rain and showers Tuesday morning,
OL,14,Fclearing later. Dry on Wednesday, with
OL,15,Fthe wind easing during the afternoon.
OL,16,FFoggy Thursday morning, with sunny
OL,17,Fspells later, and a light breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
